      "expectedOutput": "Standard Shipping ($4.99) and Express Delivery ($12.99)",
      "baselineOutput": "To get exact real-time pricing and delivery dates, carriers require an **Origin ZIP code** and **Package Dimensions** (to check for dimensional weight). \n\nHowever, based on a **2.5 kg (5.51 lbs / billed at 6 lbs)** package delivering to **San Francisco, CA (94103)**, here are the standard shipping tiers available across the major US carriers:\n\n---\n\n### Standard Shipping Tiers Available\n\n#### **1. USPS (US Postal Service)**\n*   **USPS Ground Advantage:** 2–5 business days *(Best budget option)*\n*   **USPS Priority Mail:** 1–3 business days *(Includes standard insurance)*\n*   **USPS Priority Mail Express:** Next-day to 2-day guaranteed by 6 PM\n\n#### **2. UPS**\n*   **UPS Ground / Home Delivery:** 1–5 business days *(Standard ground service)*\n*   **UPS 3 Day Select:** 3 business days\n*   **UPS 2nd Day Air:** 2 business days\n*   **UPS Next Day Air Saver:** Next business day (afternoon)\n*   **UPS Next Day Air:** Next business day (morning delivery)\n\n#### **3. FedEx**\n*   **FedEx Ground / Home Delivery:** 1–5 business days\n*   **FedEx Express Saver:** 3 business days\n*   **FedEx 2Day:** 2 business days\n*   **FedEx Priority Overnight:** Next business day by 10:30 AM\n\n---\n\n### 💻 Developer / API JSON Representation\nIf you are building an e-commerce integration or calling a shipping API (like EasyPost, Shippo, or Pitney Bowes), here is how these tiers are typically returned:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"destination_zip\": \"94103\",\n  \"weight_kg\": 2.5,\n  \"billed_weight_lbs\": 6,\n  \"available_tiers\": [\n    {\n      \"carrier\": \"USPS\",\n      \"service_code\": \"usps_ground_advantage\",\n      \"tier_name\": \"Economy Ground\",\n      \"est_delivery_days\": \"3-5\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"carrier\": \"USPS\",\n      \"service_code\": \"usps_priority_mail\",\n      \"tier_name\": \"Standard Expedited\",\n      \"est_delivery_days\": \"2-3\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"carrier\": \"UPS\",\n      \"service_code\": \"ups_ground\",\n      \"tier_name\": \"Ground\",\n      \"est_delivery_days\": \"1-5\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"carrier\": \"FedEx\",\n      \"service_code\": \"fedex_2day\",\n      \"tier_name\": \"2-Day Express\",\n      \"est_delivery_days\": \"2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"carrier\": \"UPS\",\n      \"service_code\": \"ups_next_day_air\",\n      \"tier_name\": \"Overnight\",\n      \"est_delivery_days\": \"1\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Need Exact Rates?\nPlease provide:\n1. **Origin ZIP Code** (where the package is shipping from)\n2. **Dimensions** in cm or inches (Length × Width × Height)\n3. **Preferred Carrier** (USPS, UPS, FedEx, or All)",
